        "created_at": "2016-01-26T18:58:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A hero has to be active with 10 or less health. &nbsp; Incapped heroes should not count towards it unless you use the Huge incap power of Sky Scraper. &nbsp;</p>",
